       ----bbuuiilldd==_t_y_p_e
           Specifies the build _t_y_p_e from a comma-separated list of components.

           The allowed values are:

           aannyy Generate build information including unqualified build
               dependencies (BBuuiilldd--DDeeppeennddss) and architecture specific build
               dependencies (BBuuiilldd--DDeeppeennddss--AArrcchh).

           aallll Generate build information including unqualified build
               dependencies (BBuuiilldd--DDeeppeennddss) and architecture independent build
               dependencies (BBuuiilldd--DDeeppeennddss--IInnddeepp).

           ssoouurrccee
               Effectively ignored; generate build information with just the
               unqualified build dependencies (BBuuiilldd--DDeeppeennddss).

           bbiinnaarryy
               Generate build information with all three types of build
               dependencies.  This is an alias for aannyy,,aallll.

           ffuullll
               Generate build information with all three types of build
               dependencies.  This is an alias for aannyy,,aallll,,ssoouurrccee, and the
               same as the default case when no build option is specified.

       --cc_c_o_n_t_r_o_l_f_i_l_e
