       --FF_c_h_a_n_g_e_l_o_g_-_f_o_r_m_a_t
           Specifies the format of the changelog. See ddppkkgg--ppaarrsseecchhaannggeelloogg(1)
           for information about alternative formats.

       --OO[_f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e]
           Print the buildinfo file to standard output (or _f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e if
           specified) rather than to _d_i_r//_s_o_u_r_c_e_-_n_a_m_e___b_i_n_a_r_y_-
           _v_e_r_s_i_o_n___a_r_c_h..bbuuiillddiinnffoo (where _d_i_r is .... by default or _u_p_l_o_a_d_-_f_i_l_e_s_-
