       --uu_u_p_l_o_a_d_-_f_i_l_e_s_-_d_i_r
           Look for the files to be uploaded in _u_p_l_o_a_d_-_f_i_l_e_s_-_d_i_r rather than
           ....  (ddppkkgg--ggeennbbuuiillddiinnffoo needs to find these files so that it can
