       ----aallwwaayyss--iinncclluuddee--kkeerrnneell
           By default, the BBuuiilldd--KKeerrnneell--VVeerrssiioonn field will not be written out.

           Specify this option (since dpkg 1.19.0) to always write a BBuuiilldd--
           KKeerrnneell--VVeerrssiioonn field when generating the ..bbuuiillddiinnffoo.

       ----aallwwaayyss--iinncclluuddee--ppaatthh
