           current directory starts with an allowed pattern.

           On Debian and derivatives the pattern matches on //bbuuiilldd// at the
           start of the pathname.

           Specify this option to always write a BBuuiilldd--PPaatthh field when
           generating the ..bbuuiillddiinnffoo.

       ----aaddmmiinnddiirr==_d_i_r
